  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strenghtening institutions for freedom of expression and democracy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to strengthening the democratic public through cooperation with institutions in the global South that educate journalists. This in turn will strengthen independent media, contribute to increased protection of journalists and improved access to information. The gender perspective is integrated across programmes. Specific projects focus on the protection of female journalists, and the representation of women in the media more broadly.</narrative>
  </description>
